OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity union threatens further
OL,4,Astrike action
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe union representing staff at the
OL,7,FUniversity of Nottingham (UoN) has said
OL,8,Fthe latest version of a restructuring
OL,9,Fplan does not do enough to rule out
OL,10,Ffurther strike action in 2027.
OL,12,FThe University and College Union (UCU)
OL,13,Fis currently striking until 11 December
OL,14,Fover the plan to cut courses, staff
OL,15,Fnumbers and some support - but now say
OL,16,Fthat could continue in the new year.
OL,18,FThe Future Nottingham blueprint was
OL,19,Fapproved by the university's governing
OL,20,Fbody on Thursday, and while the number
OL,21,Fof threatened jobs was reduced from 609
OL,22,Fto 480, UCU said other cuts remained.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
